    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Jean-Michel Iribarren (born 13 February 1958) is a French author. He is the author of \"L'insecte\", a monologue in which the AIDS virus speaks and the author denounces the silence that surrounded the death of homosexuals at the beginning of epidemic.",
